keyforge (0.3.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Expand superkey pattern actions and macro payloads for richer action
    sequences.
  * Resolve macros nested inside superkeys and refresh bindings after updates.
  * Sync macro editor state more reliably when loading saved data.
  * Reject unsupported rapidfire configurations on non-action superkey types.
  * Refresh mouse suppression during hold macro playback.

 -- nyrda <nyrda@keyforge.tools>  Mon, 13 Apr 2026 06:08:01 +0000

keyforge (0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add first-class Niri compositor support, including direct action dispatch.
  * Expand superkeys into pattern and overload modes with stricter validation.
  * Make superkey bindings value-aware so wheel directions and similar inputs map cleanly.
  * Split stable tagged releases from manual prerelease packaging.

 -- nyrda <nyrda@keyforge.tools>  Fri, 10 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000

keyforge (0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Seed a default editable profile on first startup.
  * Refine first-run device setup UX.

 -- nyrda <nyrda@keyforge.tools>  Tue, 07 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000

